        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "Wld2W",
          "name": "About",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "fill": "$epe-section-bg",
          "gap": 70,
          "padding": [
            90,
            80
          ],
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "F9dhb",
              "name": "AboutLeft",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 20,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "eEQSa",
                  "name": "Label",
                  "fill": "$epe-text-white",
                  "content": "About",
                  "fontFamily": "$epe-font-en",
                  "fontSize": 17,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "N0EW5U",
                  "name": "Heading",
                  "fill": "$epe-text-white",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "ハイスペックを、再定義する。",
                  "fontFamily": "$epe-font-jp",
                  "fontSize": 30,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "iRaIY",
                  "name": "Paragraphs",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 20,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "q5QfDl",
                      "fill": "$epe-text-body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "溢れかえるポケット、過剰な重厚さ、デザインのための装飾。\n都市を生きる私たちの日常に、それは本当に必要だろうか。",
                      "lineHeight": 1.8,
                      "fontFamily": "$epe-font-jp",
                      "fontSize": 14,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "wzFPk",
                      "fill": "$epe-text-body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "私たちは気づいている。\nそれはハイスペックではなく、オーバースペックであることを。",
                      "lineHeight": 1.8,
                      "fontFamily": "$epe-font-jp",
                      "fontSize": 14,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "Sgtek",
                      "fill": "$epe-text-body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "epeが追求するのは、引き算から生まれる機能美だ。\n特殊な加工を施した高密度な生地がもたらす、耐久性と軽さの最適解。\n都市のノイズを削ぎ落とした、無駄のない造形。",
                      "lineHeight": 1.8,
                      "fontFamily": "$epe-font-jp",
                      "fontSize": 14,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "ZDNDK",
                      "fill": "$epe-text-body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "真に必要なものだけを、あなたの手に。\nepeは今、ハイスペックの定義を書き換える。",
                      "lineHeight": 1.8,
                      "fontFamily": "$epe-font-jp",
                      "fontSize": 14,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "J7L34Z",
